OL,3,GNEWSANew Forest wildfire restoration
OL,4,Awork begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FRestoration work has begun at the site
OL,7,Fof a devastating wildfire in a national
OL,8,Fpark.
OL,10,FMore than 1 sq km (247 acres) of the
OL,11,FNew Forest was destroyed after a fire
OL,12,Fspread from a blazing van on 9 August.
OL,14,FThe fire caused damage to rare
OL,15,Fheathland and an ancient woodland, as
OL,16,Fwell as burning through a surface layer
OL,17,Fof peat in some of the boggy areas,
OL,18,Freducing their ability to store carbon.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
