OL,3,GNEWSANew Forest wildfire restoration
OL,4,Awork begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FForestry England said it had begun a
OL,7,Flong-term project to help nature return
OL,8,Fto the affected area, with specialist
OL,9,Fteams starting work to protect the most
OL,10,Fvulnerable areas ahead of winter and
OL,11,Fhelping to reseed areas of heather.
